      "en": "The little prince climbed a high mountain. The only mountains he had ever known were the three volcanoes that came up to his knees. And he used the extinct volcano as a stool. So he said to himself, “From a mountain as high as this, I’ll see the whole planet and all its people at a glance...” But he saw nothing but sharp needles of rock.",
